            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Jarvis stays on the screen you're working on.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.25</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Opening a meeting from a task (or any screen that needs a bigger window) no longer jumps Jarvis onto your other monitor. The window now grows in place, keeping its top edge, and stays on the display it was on.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
